OL,5,G1000 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FCarl and Brianha bring the French
OL,7,     FRiviera to Bognor Regis, with
OL,8,     Flasers and a smoke machine. Justin
OL,9,     Fand Karen do fine dining. And is
OL,10,     FMark and Lisa's curry too hot for
OL,11,     Ftheir guests to handle?
OL,12,G1100 Storage Wars: Texas
OL,13,     FWith a flick of her hair and a
OL,14,     Fflutter of her eyelashes, Jenny
OL,15,     Freckons she can score a win in
OL,16,     FFort Worth. But Bubba's
OL,17,     Fimmediately pegged her for a
OL,18,     F'shameless flirt'.
