OL,12,G1730 Storage Wars: Texas
OL,13,     FThe weather's biblical in Mineral
OL,14,     FWells, but the storm in the sky
OL,15,     Fhas nothing on Storm Victor and
OL,16,     Fhis three umbrellas. Jenny reckons
OL,17,     Fshe's found a pot of gold in her
OL,18,     Flocker.
